  "sourceTitle": "Ham and Broccoli Casserole",
  "sourceText": "Ham and Broccoli Casserole\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Sunday, December 20, 2009 - 12:03am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 ounce pkt Frozen broccoli, 10\n1 pkt Frozen french fries, 1#\n1 can Cream of mushroom soup\n3/4 cup Milk\n1 1/2 cups Ham, cubed\n1 cup Cheddar cheese, gr\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Spray dish with Pam. Place fries in 9x13 dish. Sprinkle broccoli over fries. Blend soup and milk. Add ham. Pour mixture over broccoli. 2 Sprinkle cheese on top. Bake at 350 F 25 minutes.",
